      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天，伴随着她那句\n“不再重蹈覆辙”的誓言，\n我们按照新的项目重新展开训练──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d64968a19a1b91a95baa9b4715d66f895bcac8023d47e6c0cc487e9aa21ba9",
